                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek. 36.17-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Penya Rwot pirwa, pien Nebukadnejar, abaka me Babulon amito cako lweny kedwa. Atot onyo ca Rwot bino timo tano moro me awura pirwa, te miyogi ya dokoko cen, kun oweko lweny kedwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
